OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain around the east coast
OL,6,Fearly morning. Otherwise a day of
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers with outbreaks
OL,8,Ffocused across Dumfries and Galloway,
OL,9,Fwhere they build for the afternoon.
OL,10,FBrisk southwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers dying away from the
OL,13,Feast during the evening to leave a
OL,14,Flargely dry night with clear spells
OL,15,Fappearing most readily in the east.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FWindy. Most staying dry
OL,18,Fthrough to mid-afternoon with some
OL,19,Flimited early brightness. Patchy rain
OL,20,Ffeeding from the west late afternoon
OL,21,Fto early evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
