OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain Thursday, clearing erratically as
OL,7,Fbrighter spells and showers feed from
OL,8,Fthe northwest. Showers for Friday,
OL,9,Ffocused in west. Saturday mainly dry,
OL,10,Foccasionally bright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
